<!--
    Strings owned by the staff screens (plan §6.3, §7).

    Copy rules: sentence case, verb-first, no "please", no exclamation marks, no "successfully".
    ALL CAPS is never typed here - the Overline type role does the caps. Status words follow the
    §5.4 mapping so a badge and a heading never disagree.
-->
