    <!-- ═════════ Shared staff vocabulary (§7.7) ═════════
         One table, every staff surface (scan, my scans, transactions, organizer views):

             pass          the attendee's QR credential - never "QR code", never "ticket"
             check in      accepting a pass at the door; "checked in" is the accepted state
             not valid     a pass that cannot be used for this scan - never "rejected by backend"
             scan          one pass presented at the door - the unit a report counts
             event         the organizer's event - never "session"
             points        the reward currency - never "credits"

         A server reason is shown verbatim as a detail line; it is never pattern-matched. -->
